   "lines": [
    [
     "c04_1",
     {
      "label": "hook",
      "head": "One foot stops *two tonnes*",
      "pose": "point",
      "face": "wow",
      "prop": {
       "type": "brake"
      }
     },
     "How can one foot stop a two tonne car? Hydraulics, and friction."
    ],
    [
     "c04_2",
     {
      "label": "hydraulics",
      "head": "The pedal pushes *fluid*",
      "pose": "present",
      "face": "smile",
      "prop": {
       "type": "brake",
       "squeeze": 0.2
      }
     },
     "The pedal pushes brake fluid through sealed pipes. Liquid barely compresses, so the push travels instantly to every wheel."
    ],
    [
     "c04_3",
     {
      "label": "multiply",
      "head": "Small piston, *big* force",
      "pose": "count",
      "face": "grin",
      "prop": {
       "type": "versus",
       "a": {
        "t": "PEDAL PISTON",
        "big": "small",
        "sub": "short push"
       },
       "b": {
        "t": "WHEEL PISTONS",
        "big": "BIG",
        "sub": "huge force"
       },
       "win": "b"
      }
     },
     "A small piston at the pedal pushes bigger pistons at the wheels, multiplying the force. A vacuum or electric booster adds even more."
    ],
    [
     "c04_4",
     {
      "label": "friction",
      "head": "Pads *squeeze* the disc",
      "pose": "present",
      "face": "smile",
      "prop": {
       "type": "brake"
      }
     },
     "At the wheel, the caliper squeezes friction pads onto a spinning steel disc."
    ],
    [
     "c04_5",
     {
      "label": "heat",
      "head": "Your speed becomes *heat*",
      "pose": "shy",
      "face": "worried",
      "prop": {
       "type": "brake",
       "squeeze": 1
      }
     },
     "Friction turns all that movement into heat. Race car discs can glow at over a thousand degrees."
    ],
    [
     "c04_6",
     {
      "label": "abs",
      "head": "*ABS* stops the wheels locking",
      "pose": "think",
      "face": "think",
      "prop": {
       "type": "stat",
       "big": "ABS",
       "sub": "PULSES THE BRAKES SO YOU CAN STILL STEER"
      }
     },
     "A locked wheel skids, and you cannot steer. ABS senses this, and releases and reapplies the brake many times a second."
    ],
    [
     "c04_7",
     {
      "label": "check",
      "head": "Warning signs to *never ignore*",
      "pose": "count",
      "face": "worried",
      "prop": {
